{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"shoe-size-converter UI copy.details","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"shoe-size-converter.copy.details","keys":["shoe-size-converter.copy.details"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Wannan kayan aiki na canja mm, cm ko inci zuwa millimita, yana amfani da mafi tsawo daga ƙafafunka biyu kuma yana gano mafi kusa da tsawo a cikin chati da ka saka. An ƙara wani tsawo kawai idan ɗakin ƙafafunka na chati ya bayyana tsawo na ciki na takalma. An nuna Mondopoint kamar tsawo na ƙafafun da aka auna a cikin millimita; ba a canja shi zuwa wani tsarin ba.","record_id":"8039e10d5c05cf4f70f2995802f89b97cfdcb960ad2433f290f3871212770a99","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.598250080750006,"source":"The tool converts mm, cm or inches into millimetres, uses the longer of your two feet and finds the closest length in the chart you paste. A toe allowance is added only when your chart column describes shoe interior length. Mondopoint is shown as the measured foot length in millimetres; it is not converted into another system.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"ed95f0c030255c698f5e993999ab9b00fc24ffe5abde57d880ed2b75038cf02f","status":"needs-review","translation":"Wannan kayan aiki na canja mm, cm ko inci zuwa millimita, yana amfani da mafi tsawo daga ƙafafunka biyu kuma yana gano mafi kusa da tsawo a cikin chati da ka saka. An ƙara wani tsawo kawai idan ɗakin ƙafafunka na chati ya bayyana tsawo na ciki na takalma. An nuna Mondopoint kamar tsawo na ƙafafun da aka auna a cikin millimita; ba a canja shi zuwa wani tsarin ba.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
